1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,620
People can play video games on different platforms.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,900
A platform is the place or device you use to play.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,640
A phone is easy to carry.

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,660
A computer can be good for many online games.

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,420
A console connects to a TV or screen.

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,780
A tablet can feel simple and relaxed.

7
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,060
Some people play for a short time.

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:21,140
They play one quick game on the train or at home.

9
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,960
Other people play for a longer time with friends.

10
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:29,980
The important English is simple: name the platform, name the game, and say when you play.

11
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,340
There are many kinds of games.

12
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:37,060
In an action game, players move quickly and make fast choices.

13
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:42,100
In a sports game, players can play soccer, basketball, baseball, or racing.

14
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:47,160
In an adventure game, players explore new places and find useful items.

15
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,240
Building games are different.

16
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:53,660
Players can make houses, towns, farms, or their own world.

17
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,620
Puzzle games are also different.

18
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:58,640
Players think carefully and solve a small problem.

19
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:02,660
Many people like different kinds of games at different times.

20
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:05,060
Some games are single-player games.

21
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:06,940
One person plays alone.

22
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:09,620
This can be good when you want quiet time.

23
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:11,920
Some games are team games.

24
00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:16,740
Friends work together, talk, help each other, and make a plan.

25
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:19,660
Playing with friends needs simple communication.

26
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:26,920
Friends can choose the game, agree on the time, and decide if they want voice chat or short messages.

27
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:30,600
Good game English is friendly, clear, and not too long.

28
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:33,340
Friends do not always want the same game.

29
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,820
One friend may want a fast action game.

30
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:38,760
Another friend may want a calm building game.

31
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:43,700
It is useful to explain the reason, not only the game name.

32
00:01:44,660 --> 00:01:47,620
Friends can also make a small plan before they start.

33
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:55,420
They choose the platform, choose the game type, choose the time, and choose one rule for playing safely.
